# Cloudflare Pages _redirects
#
# Intentionally empty of rules.
#
# This file used to hold four redirects for legacy /quiz-bank/* and
# /app/index.html paths, written with absolute source URLs
# (https://thenursingcollective.pro/quiz-bank/*). Cloudflare Pages requires
# RELATIVE source paths, warned about these on every build, and dropped them —
# verified in production on 24 Nov 2026, where both paths returned 404.
#
# They were not rewritten as relative rules because the destination is the live
# learn subdomain, and a relative rule applies to preview deployments too,
# which would send preview testers to production. They now live in
# functions/_middleware.js, which already distinguishes the production host.
#
# If you add a rule here, the source must be a relative path (/old-path/*) and
# it will apply to previews as well as production.
